# portfolio.txt — stocks you have BOUGHT / currently hold.
# Copy this file to portfolio.txt (which stays out of git) and list one
# Bursa stock code per line. Comments after # are ignored.
#
# Insider alerts for these stocks ALWAYS get sent (tagged 📌 HOLDING),
# bypassing the i_report filter — you want to know about every insider
# change in stocks you own.
#
# Example:
# 5323          # my main holding
# 7081
# 0166          # speculative position
